    "custom_liquid_cfAz7N": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"product-listbase\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col-md-8\">\n        <!-- Tabs -->\n        <div class=\"tabs-page\">\n          <ul class=\"tab-buttons\">\n            <li><a href=\"javascript:void(0);\" onclick=\"showtab('AboutProduct',this);\" class=\"active\">Anti Ageing</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"javascript:void(0);\" onclick=\"showtab('Whykairali',this);\">Why Kairali?</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Anti Ageing Tab Content -->\n        <div id=\"AboutProduct\" class=\"tabcontent\" style=\"display: block;\">\n          <div class=\"antiage-wrapper\">\n            <h2>What is Anti-Ageing?</h2>\n            <p>Anti-ageing is a process of retaining, delaying, and stopping the ageing process which usually deteriorates with time. It is very important for us to keep a regular check on the causes or factors that might deteriorate our skin. There are many natural ways that can help us keep our skin healthy and supple.</p>\n\n            <h3>What are the Skin-Ageing Signs?</h3>\n            <p>Our skin changes with age, but there are various other reasons like climate, dry weather, improper diet, and lifestyle habits that make our skin liable to premature ageing. We can notice initial signs like wrinkles, fine lines, and visible dark spots. Biologically, our body undergoes natural changes, but we can manage external ageing factors to slow down the visible effects.</p>\n\n            <h3>Signs of Ageing</h3>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Wrinkles</li>\n              <li>Fine lines</li>\n              <li>Dark spots</li>\n              <li>Pigmentation</li>\n              <li>Drooping upper eyelids</li>\n              <li>Patchy skin</li>\n              <li>Dull and sagging skin</li>\n              <li>Open pores</li>\n            </ul>\n\n            <h3>Factors of Ageing According to Ayurveda</h3>\n            <p>Many factors lead to changes in our skin and body. These may be natural or external, but when unmanaged, they become harmful in the long run:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Stress</li>\n              <li>Improper Diet</li>\n              <li>Poor lifestyle</li>\n              <li>Lack of proper sleep</li>\n              <li>Lack of nourishment</li>\n              <li>Lack of hydration</li>\n            </ul>\n\n            <p><strong>Aahaar (Diet)</strong> is a major issue that must be corrected and followed daily, as proper food impacts overall skin health. Ayurveda sees food as medicine.</p>\n            <p><strong>Vihaara (Lifestyle)</strong> includes early rising, light exercise, warm water, regular sleep, and avoiding junk—all contributing to healthy ageing.</p>\n\n            <h3>Solutions in Ayurveda by Kairali Ayurvedic Products</h3>\n            <p>To address common skin issues, Kairali introduces Ayurvedic skincare solutions for youthful, radiant skin:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li><strong>Kaircin:</strong> Ayurvedic facial night serum</li>\n              <li><strong>Kairpack:</strong> Ayurvedic face pack for soft, supple skin</li>\n              <li><strong>Kairkare:</strong> Body massage oil for detoxifying and de-stressing</li>\n              <li><strong>Kairbal:</strong> Ayurvedic cleansing powder for glowing skin</li>\n            </ul>\n\n            <h3>Why Internal Detox Matters</h3>\n            <p>Skin health begins from within. Detoxifying the body regularly helps prevent dullness and flakiness. Spices like turmeric, fennel, coriander, and fenugreek can improve internal health. Yoga and meditation support healthy, glowing skin.</p>\n\n            <h3>Key Ingredients Used by Kairali Ayurvedic Products</h3>\n            <p>Kairali has been producing Ayurvedic health solutions since 1908 using 100% natural ingredients:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Saffron</li>\n              <li>Lotus</li>\n              <li>Green gram</li>\n              <li>Sandalwood</li>\n            </ul>\n\n            <p><strong>Kaircin:</strong> A nourishing oil with saffron and lotus that revives youthful glow.</p>\n            <p><strong>Kairpack:</strong> Herbal face pack with anti-inflammatory ingredients for blemish-free skin.</p>\n            <p><strong>Kairbal:</strong> Natural exfoliating scrub that removes dead skin and impurities.</p>\n            <p><strong>Kairkare:</strong> Herbal massage oil for fitness and stress relief used for decades by Kairali.</p>\n\n            <h3>Ayurvedic Tips for an Effective Skin Care Regime</h3>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Eat seasonal vegetables</li>\n              <li>Sip herbal or green tea</li>\n              <li>Practice yoga or exercise regularly</li>\n              <li>Get 7–8 hours of sound sleep</li>\n              <li>Drink 8–10 litres of water daily</li>\n              <li>Take regular Ayurvedic therapies</li>\n              <li>Smile and stay happy</li>\n            </ul>\n\n            <p>For expert support or consultation, please <strong>contact us</strong>. Use Ayurvedic products under the guidance of certified Ayurvedic doctors.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Why Kairali Tab Content -->\n        <div id=\"Whykairali\" class=\"tabcontent\">\n          <div class=\"antiage-wrapper\">\n            <h2>Why Kairali?</h2>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Kairali is a Trusted Brand.</li>\n              <li>It’s best in Ayurveda.</li>\n              <li>Kairali is a top award-winning company.</li>\n              <li>It operates in 35 locations in 9 countries across 3 continents.</li>\n              <li>Kairali uses top quality raw materials and follows international guidelines while manufacturing products.</li>\n              <li>Guaranteed quality and safety – Kairali is dedicated to enhancing the good name of Ayurveda and follows strict development protocols.</li>\n              <li>Government certified – GMP certified by Tamil Nadu, Karnataka, and Kerala governments.</li>\n              <li>Research and development – A strong team of Ayurvedic physicians and chemists.</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Toggle Script -->\n<script>\n  function showtab(tabId, element) {\n    var tabs = document.querySelectorAll(\".tabcontent\");\n    var links = document.querySelectorAll(\".tab-buttons a\");\n\n    tabs.forEach(tab => tab.style.display = \"none\");\n    links.forEach(link => link.classList.remove(\"active\"));\n\n    document.getElementById(tabId).style.display = \"block\";\n    element.classList.add(\"active\");\n  }\n</script>\n\n<!-- CSS -->\n<style>\n.product-listbase {\n  padding: 40px 0;\n  font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n  color: #333;\n}\n.tabs-page ul.tab-buttons {\n  display: flex;\n  list-style: none;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 0 0 20px;\n  border-bottom: 2px solid #eee;\n}\n.tabs-page ul.tab-buttons li {\n  margin-right: 20px;\n}\n.tabs-page ul.tab-buttons a {\n  display: block;\n  padding: 10px 15px;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #444;\n  border-bottom: 3px solid transparent;\n  transition: 0.3s ease;\n}\n.tabs-page ul.tab-buttons a.active {\n  border-color: #c59d5f;\n  color: #c59d5f;\n}\n.tabcontent {\n  display: none;\n}\n.antiage-wrapper {\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  padding: 20px 30px;\n  max-width: 1000px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  text-align: justify;\n}\n.antiage-wrapper h2,\n.antiage-wrapper h3 {\n  color: #c59d5f;\n  margin-top: 30px;\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n.antiage-wrapper p {\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n.antiage-wrapper ul {\n  margin: 15px 0;\n  padding-left: 20px;\n}\n.antiage-wrapper ul li {\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n  list-style: disc;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .tabs-page ul.tab-buttons {\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .tabs-page ul.tab-buttons li {\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n.antiage-wrapper {\n    padding: 15px 20px;\n  }\n}\n  .antiage-wrapper h2, .antiage-wrapper h3 {\n    font-size: 18px;\n  }\n}\n</style>"
      }
    },
    "flex_content_section_himanshu_GVzxX4": {
      "type": "flex-content-section-himanshu",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_content_YrWHaj": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "tab_1_title": "Anti Ageing",
            "tab_1_content": "<h1><strong>What is anti-ageing?</strong></h1><p>Anti-ageing is a process of retaining, delaying and stopping the ageing process which usually deteriorates with time. It is very important for us to keep a regular check on the causes or factors that might deteriorate our skin. There are many natural ways that can help us keep our skin healthy and supple.</p><h2><strong>What are the skin-ageing signs?</strong></h2><p>Our skin changes with age, but there are various other reasons for which our skin tends to grow and change like climate, dry weather, improper dietary routine, lifestyle habits etc. that are some of it that makes our skin liable to transformations. We can notice the initial ageing signs when we start getting wrinkles on our face, fine lines on the cheek area and visible dark spots. Biologically speaking, our body and skin undergoes many changes and with age those changes becomes visible and that is something which we term as the ageing signs. We do not have control on these changes, however, we can definitely put a control to the other factors that will lead our skin to age prematurely.</p><h3><strong>Signs of Ageing</strong></h3><p>Our facial skin is the most vulnerable part when it comes to skin ageing. Let us look at the signs of skin ageing:</p><ul><li>Wrinkles</li><li>Fine lines</li><li>Dark spots</li><li>Pigmentation</li><li>Drooping upper eyelids</li><li>Patchy skin</li><li>Dull and sagging skin</li><li>Open pores</li></ul><h3><strong>Factors of Ageing According to Ayurveda</strong></h3><p>There are numerous factors that lead our skin to change at regular intervals. As the process of ageing cannot be stopped, so does some of the external factors keeps on getting repeated to us. These factors are harmful for the skin and body in the long run, as it poses itself a barrier between healthy living and simple living. The major factors that stops the healthy growing process of our body and skin are:</p><ul><li>Stress</li><li>Improper Diet</li><li>Poor lifestyle</li><li>Lack of proper sleep</li><li>Lack of proper nourishment</li><li>Lack of rehydration</li></ul><p><strong>Aahaar (Diet)</strong> is major issue that needs to be corrected and implemented within the daily routine as it is responsible for the changes that occur in our body. Proper healthy food reflects in the overall appearance of an individual and Ayurveda believes that food is the primary medicine for all diseases.<br/><br/><strong>Vihaara (Lifestyle)</strong> is more of a planned change that requires to be adapted for a healthy living. Waking up early in the morning, a bit of physical exercise, cutting down on junk food, drinking warm water, sleeping on time etc. and many more are some of the lifestyle changes that requires to be followed for a healthy living.</p><h3><strong>Solutions in Ayurveda by Kairali Ayurvedic Products</strong></h3><p>Viewing the various skin problems, Kairali Ayurvedic Products introduced some Ayurvedic anti-ageing skin care products that helps to keep the skin healthy and glowing with age.  </p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.kairaliproducts.in/kaircin-25ml.html\">Kaircin - An Ayurvedic facial night serum</a></li><li><a href=\"/products/kairpack-best-ayurvedic-herbal-face-pack-for-glowing-skin\">Kairpack - An Ayurvedic Face pack</a> for Soft and Supple Skin</li><li><a href=\"/products/kairkare-ayurvedic-herbal-body-massage-oil\">Kairkare - An Ayurvedic Body Massage Oil</a> for Detoxifying and De-stressing</li><li><a href=\"/products/kairbal-ayurvedic-body-cleansing-powder-herbal-body-wash-powder\">Kairbal- Ayurvedic Body Cleansing Powder</a> for Beautiful Glowing Skin</li></ul><p>These Ayurvedic solutions for anti-ageing by Kairali are highly recommended for an ageless and radiant skin.<br/><br/>Purification of the blood is highly essential in maintaining a healthy skin and body. If the body is not detoxified from time to time, both, internally and externally, our skin seems to be dry and flaky. In this case, skin-friendly spices like turmeric, fenugreek, fennel, black pepper and coriander can be used in making healthy cuisines that increase the quality of the skin. Physical exercises, meditation and Yoga are some form of lifestyle choices that one should adapt in order to increase the stamina as well for a radiant skin.</p><h3><strong>Key Ingredients used by Kairali Ayurvedic Products:</strong> </h3><p>Kairali Ayurvedic Products has been introducing Ayurvedic solutions for various health issues sibce 1908. The ingredients used are completely natural and the common key ingredients in making the products are as follows:</p><ul><li>Saffron</li><li>Lotus</li><li>Green gram</li><li>Sandalwood</li></ul><p><strong>Kaircin: </strong>This Ayurvedic facial oil is composed of quality natural ingredients (saffron and lotus) which nourish your skin and gives radiant and youthful skin. The oil promises to restore your youthful glow.<br/><br/><strong>Kairpack: </strong>The Ayurvedic face pack is filled with herbal richness, and all the medicinal herbs that are used in the product have anti-microbial and anti-inflammatory properties. The face pack, in the long run, helps to get rid of blemishes, acne marks, pimples and dark spots from the face.<br/><br/><strong>Kairbal: </strong>The benefits of using this Ayurvedic powder are many, and when used daily, this natural scrub helps to remove the dead skin cells and revives the skin imparting a natural glow to it. Kairbal powder washes away the dirt and all other impurities. The special formula of this herbal powder provides the required exfoliation.<br/><br/><strong>Kairkare: </strong>This Kairkare oil has been used in the Ayurveda as a complete body massage oil. “Kairali” has being using this Oil for more than three decades and has proven that regular message of the Kairkare Oil one can stay fit and stress free.</p><h3><strong>Ayurvedic Tips for an Effective Skin Care Regime</strong></h3><p>We recommend natural steps to protect and heal your skin that can give you an ageless skin.</p><ul><li>Include seasonal vegetables in your diet.</li><li>Sip herbal tea/green tea in the evening.</li><li>Practice exercises frequently or Yoga.</li><li>Get 7-8 hours of sound sleep.</li><li>Drink 8-10 litres of water every day.</li><li>Regular Ayurvedic therapies is an added advantage for a healthy skin and body.</li><li>Smile and stay happy.</li></ul><p>For any kind of support or assistance, kindly contact us.<br/><br/>All the products are recommended to be used as per the advice given by our Ayurvedic physician.</p>",
            "tab_2_title": "Why Kairali?",
            "tab_2_content": "<h2>Why Kairali?</h2><ul><li>Kairali is a Trusted Brand.</li><li>Its best in Ayurveda.</li><li>Kairali is a top award winning company.</li><li>It operates in 35 locations in 9 countries across 3 continents.</li><li>Kairali uses top quality raw material and follow international guidelines while manufacturing products. Good quality hygiene is maintained while processing which makes us one of the best in the world.</li><li>Guaranteed quality and safety – Kairali is dedicated towards enhancing the good name of Ayurveda and follow strict parameters in development of its products and its treatment.</li><li>Government certified – Our facilities are certified with GMP (Good manufacturing practices) by the government of Tamil Nadu, Karnataka and Kerala.</li><li>Research and development – Kairali's research and development team has great Ayurvedic physicians and new age chemists with years of experience and expertise. </li></ul>"
          }
        },
